flowchart TD
    A[Medication Log Created] --> B[Status: Pending]
    B --> C{Scheduled Time Reached?}
    C -- No (Waiting) --> B
    C -- Yes --> D[Grace Period Window]

    D -- User Takes --> E[Status: Taken]
    D -- Grace Expires --> F[Status: Missed]
    D -- User Skips --> G[Status: Skipped]

    E --> H[Completed]
    F --> H
    G --> H
